      "provenance": {
        "source": "onnxruntime/test/providers/cpu/math/element_wise_ops_test.cc",
        "test": "MathOpTest.Min_12_Float_with_scalar_Nan",
        "notes": "Diverges from the upstream test's inputs (inputs.a values [0.25, -0.25, -0.5, 0.5] -> constant 0.25); the expected output is recomputed by the CPU reference for the new inputs. A NaN scalar operand propagates to every element whatever the other operand holds, so the tensor operand is uniform: any finite result fails."
      },
